<span id="A1.T3.2.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">What word immediately comes to mind when you hear [physical attribute]? The word is:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T3.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T3.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r" style="padding-top:2.5pt;padding-bottom:2.5pt;">
